1
00:00:00,134 --> 00:00:01,944
(Howard:)You're best friends.

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:05,280
(Howard:)And that's a beautiful thing.

3
00:00:06,974 --> 00:00:10,824
(Howard:)I mean, Leonard, you know
why he's so mad at you?

4
00:00:10,978 --> 00:00:13,288
It's 'cause he missed you!

5
00:00:13,447 --> 00:00:16,357
(Howard:)Yeah, and as his friend,
you should be happy

6
00:00:16,517 --> 00:00:20,197
(Howard:)he has love in his life.

7
00:00:20,354 --> 00:00:22,304
(Howard:)As I do.

8
00:00:24,325 --> 00:00:27,735
(Howard:)This man held my breast
the other day, and I love him for it.

9
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,840
(Raj:)A little loud, dude.

10
00:00:34,235 --> 00:00:38,205
(Howard:)So can we please put aside
these petty differences

11
00:00:38,372 --> 00:00:41,682
(Howard:)and just be glad
we're here together?

12
00:00:44,145 --> 00:00:45,485
(Stuart:)-Okay.
-I suppose so.

13
00:00:45,646 --> 00:00:47,426
(Penny:)Thank you.

14
00:00:49,383 --> 00:00:52,163
(Raj:)It wasn't anything weird.
It was just to see how big they were.

15
00:00:58,326 --> 00:01:01,276
(Sheldon:)And then Leonard took me
to the barber and the dentist,

